intl: internationalization with ICU of the package az (collation,
number and date formats, normalization, transliteration), the intl
bundled in PHP 5.6 (the official tree had it for 5.6 as the PECL
port devel/pecl-intl).

The module intl of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/intl.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/intl.
